			"Message": "build(Rest): Rebuild Rest binary\n\nThe Rest OXC-based JavaScript bundler binary has been rebuilt. This binary is the CLI entry point for the Rest crate, responsible for bundling VS Code platform code for consumption by the Cocoon extension host sidecar.\n\nBinary regeneration follows source changes in the Rest crate. The updated binary maintains identical CLI interface, platform detection, binary resolution, and process execution behavior.",
